            "comprehends": [
             "copies/vb685pd6967#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil. Four groups: 192 with a stop, then three date groups. Read as roll number 192 and the date 10.10.11. The two 10s are each a 1 followed by a narrow open oval; 16 would need a bowl on the baseline and I do not see one."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
